#: prefs.js:343
msgid ""
"The 7z format (AES-256) encrypts the archive headers, hiding the internal "
"file name and per-entry sizes; opening it requires an application with 7z "
"support (this extension uses the system 7-Zip). ZIP stays portable but "
"reveals them. A new vault is created in 7z by default; an existing archive "
"keeps its current format until you switch it here — the conversion is then "
"offered on the next unlock (or right away while the vault is unlocked) and "
"runs once you confirm it; the file is renamed to match (.zip ↔ .7z) and the "
"old copy is kept until you delete it."
msgstr ""

